#solution[
$(1) because f ( x ) = cases(2 x ^(2 ) - a x - 2 a "," x < a, a x - 2 a "," x >= a)$ 是 $R$ 上的单调函数, 

 $therefore y=2 x^(2)-a x-2 a$ 在 $(- infinity , a)$ 上是单调函数, 

