 $(2)$ 当 $a=1$ 时, $f ( x ) = cases(2 x ^(2 ) - x - 2 "," x < 1, x - 2 "," x >= 1)$ , 

① $x<1$ 时, $f ( x ) _(min ) = f ( (1 )/(4 ) ) = - (17 )/(8 )$ ; $x >= 1$ 时, $f(x)_(min)=f(1)=-1$ , 

 $because - (17 )/(8 ) < - 1$ , 

 $therefore f(x)$ 的最小值为 $- (17 )/(8 )$ ; 

