已知 $a = (31 )/(32 )$ , $b = cos (1 )/(4 )$ , $c = 5 sin (1 )/(5 )$ , 则 #parentheses
#choices(
  ([$a<b<c$], [$c<a<b$], [$b<a<c$], [$c<b<a$]),
