#solution[
设圆为单位圆, $A(0, 1)$ , $angle A O B = x , x in ( 0 , ( pi )/(2 ) )$ , 

点 $B$ 在 $x$ 轴上的射影点为 $T$ , 过点 $A$ 作 $x$ 轴的垂线, 交 $O B$ 于点 $P$ , 

 #image("images/f3879c50.png", width: 25%) 

根据三角函数的定义有: $|B T|=sin x,|A P|=tan x$ , $l _(ˆ A B ) =x$ ,

由图知 $S_("△" A O B)<S_("扇形" A O B)<S_("△" A O P)$ , 故 $(1 )/(2 )$ × $1$ × $|B T|<(1 )/(2 )$ × $1$ × $l _(ˆ A B ) <(1 )/(2 )$ × $1$ × $|A P|$ , 

所以 $sin x < x < tan x , x in ( 0 , ( pi )/(2 ) )$ , 

所以 $(c )/(b ) = (5 sin (1 )/(5 ) )/(5 ) > (5 sin (1 )/(5 ) )/(5 ) = 5 tan (1 )/(5 ) > 5 times (1 )/(5 ) = 1$ , 即 $c>b$ ,

 $b = cos (1 )/(4 ) = 1 - 2 s i n ^(2 ) (1 )/(8 ) > 1 - 2 times ( (1 )/(8 ) ) ^(2 ) = (31 )/(32 ) = a$ , 即 $b>a$ ,

所以 $c>b>a$ .

故选: $A$ ．

]
